  "kind": "class",
  "title": "zazz module class diagram",
  "folder": "macos/rust/zazzled/src/zazz",
  "description": "The types the zazz module declares. Most commands are functions over Zazz (the daemon's zazz state) that return JSON; the types are the registry, the build pipeline's products, the worker pool, a call's streams and result, the sandbox policy (with Linux's Landlock and seccomp structures in sandbox.rs's linux module) and the grants extension of authority certificates. Manifest, Archive and Envelope come from zazz-format, Ctx from the command layer; they are lightweight nodes.",
